10. Loss Audit

For every final English candidate:

```text
LOSS =
  w1 * ambiguity_destroyed
+ w2 * rhetoric_destroyed
+ w3 * morphology_destroyed
+ w4 * sound_destroyed
+ w5 * register_destroyed
+ w6 * historical_sense_distorted
+ w7 * relation_distorted
```

Not all loss can be avoided.

The engine minimizes unreported loss.

If English cannot carry a feature:

```text
CARRY IN LINE
    else
CARRY IN TYPOGRAPHY
    else
CARRY IN FOOTNOTE
    else
CARRY IN PARALLEL RENDERING
    else
MARK AS LOST
```

Nothing important should disappear silently.

