15. Training Loop

STRATA improves through adjudicated deltas:

```text
MODEL READING
    ↓
SCHOLAR / READER CHALLENGE
    ↓
EVIDENCE COMPARISON
    ↓
DELTA
    ↓
CAUSE OF ERROR
    ↓
RULE / FEATURE / CORPUS FIX
    ↓
REGRESSION TEST
    ↓
NEW CAPABILITY
```

Do not merely store the corrected translation.

Store why the previous route failed.

